/-!
# LeaTTa-backed DIndG artifact evaluator

This module instantiates the runtime-generic `DIndGArtifactEvaluator` interface
with LeaTTa's executable MeTTa evaluator. The intent is narrow: observe the MIK
kernel's `nf` / `infer` / `conv` readouts by loading their MeTTa rules into a
LeaTTa environment, then prove small concrete soundness facts linking LeaTTa's
verified MOPS query relation to the Lean declaration calculus.

CeTTa is not part of this instance. A deployment runtime can be related later by
a separate runtime-correspondence theorem to this LeaTTa-backed semantics.
-/

